  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759200,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1000 Tiny Claws: A Sky-Pirate Swarm Survival\n\nEmbark on a frantic, arcade-style adventure in *1000 Tiny Claws*, a PlayStation Minis game where you must save a sky-pirate crew from a dire fate! Your actions may have inadvertently unleashed a devastating curse of giant insects upon the world, leaving you with just 24 hours to avert execution.\n\nTake control of First Mate Rana and battle through relentless hordes of swarming insects in a visually striking world of sky-islands and pirate intrigue. Master a fast-paced combat system featuring combo attacks, running swipes, blocks, dodges, and devastating special moves to turn the tide against the overwhelming swarm.  \n\nJoin Rana, Captain Bluebell, and Mr. Yoho as you navigate perilous situations, concoct questionable plans, and celebrate with fruity cocktails – all while desperately trying to break the curse.  Can you survive the onslaught and clear your crew's name before time runs out? Prepare for a chaotic and challenging experience in this unique PSP title!"
    },
